        "official_en_sha256": "200477130c7cf82fce176dfc030d5d570da59b18ddb10009ab9677f7af3ce963"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いきなり来てごめんな。\r\nサクラに頼まれて、スニウ村へ\r\nポーションを届けることになって。",
        "official_en": "Sorry to barge in. We’re here with Sakura to deliver potions to Sunioo.",
        "real_en": "Sorry to show up out of nowhere. Sakura asked us to deliver potions to Sunioo Village."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
