      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そこにおいてあるのが\r\nスニウ村向けの特製ポーションよ。",
        "official_en": "The potions sitting over there are meant for Sunioo.",
        "real_en": "Those over there are the special potions for Sunioo Village."
