        "official_en_sha256": "6dfcd456553f10278ff7653882eb8f37e6cf4e45632bc6491151e5fc975cae9e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "サクラ、いいんですか？\r\nよそ者にそんなことを頼んで。",
        "official_en": "Are you certain this is a good idea, Sakura? Can we truly trust them with a matter of such importance?",
        "real_en": "Sakura, are you sure? Asking outsiders to do that?"
      },
